# What a release is built from: requirements.txt plus the build tool.
# requirements-release.txt is generated from this file and is what CI installs,
# with --require-hashes, so a tag always builds with the same libraries.
#
# Regenerate after changing requirements.txt, on Windows with Python 3.12:
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe requirements-release.in
# then bring THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses/ to the versions it pins:
# tests/test_third_party_notices.py fails until they agree.
-r requirements.txt
pyinstaller
